WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome to Shadows 2.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:09.440
Now, this indie horror game just came out yesterday, it's very recent, but it's already getting good reviews.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.180
Not that I know what it's about because I've never played Shadows 1.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.980
But I always play things out of order, "because that's how Markiplier do." - Markiplier 2016

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:21.300
So, it's apparently past midnight at the office.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.840
Wonder what's gonna happen (probably rainbows and sunshine)

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.260
Ohh. Oh, it's got camera. Woah.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.420
What was that?... It was a book flying across the room.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.080
Ohhkay. Aaaah.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.420
For a second there I thought it was gonna be like, Five Nights at Freddy's style,

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.420
but it doesn't look like that may be it.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:42.260
Ohhkay...

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:45.840
Aaahhhh.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.060
Uh-oh.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.060
Wait, does that make me a security guard,

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.980
