00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.540
Why am I at an office alone?

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:55.440
"Open inventory..."

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.120
"You can enable/disable object hints in the options"

00:00:58.560 --> 00:00:59.800
