00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.140
Alright.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.220
So- "Switch flashlight mode"?

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:21.120
Ohhhhh!

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.460
Ooh, it's got a brightness setting,

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:24.280
COOL!

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.400
